(7574071, 1215796, 5364, '<td valign="top">Because I forgot to put it in the details when I uploaded it, here are the processing details:<br/> <br/>Processed from RAW in PhotoFlow:<br/> Crop<br/> Channel Mixer to convert to monochrome (0% red, 100% green, 0% blue)<br/> Curves to increase the contrast<br/> <br/>In GIMP 2.10.2:<br/> Resize<br/> Unsharp mask to sharpen<br/></td>', 'Because I forgot to put it in the details when I uploaded it, here are the processing details: Processed from RAW in PhotoFlow: Crop Channel Mixer to convert to monochrome (0% red, 100% green, 0% blue) Curves to increase the contrast In GIMP 2.10.2: Resize Unsharp mask to sharpen', '2018-06-27 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
